    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University's Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations (ISMC) and East Africa Institute (EAI) jointly organised a two-day conference exploring the relationship between Muslims and the governance structures of the countries in which they reside.",
